MAE · Derivatives · Product and Quotient Rule
Đề: Use the Quotient Rule to find the derivative of f(x)=\frac{\sqrt{x}+2x}{7x-4x^2}.
LaTeX: f(x)=\frac{\sqrt{x}+2x}{7x-4x^2}
Các bước giải: 
Đáp án: f'(x)=\frac{\left(\frac{1}{2}x^{-1/2}+2\right)(7x-4x^2)-(x^{1/2}+2x)(7-8x)}{(7x-4x^2)^2}
Khái niệm dùng: quotient_rule, fractional_exponents, power_rule, radical_functions

MAE · Derivatives · Differentiation Formulas
Đề: Find the derivative of y=√x+8∛x−2⁴√x.
LaTeX: y=\sqrt{x}+8\sqrt[3]{x}-2\sqrt[4]{x}
Các bước giải: 
Đáp án: \frac{dy}{dx}=\frac{1}{2}x^{-\frac{1}{2}}+\frac{8}{3}x^{-\frac{2}{3}}-\frac{1}{2}x^{-\frac{3}{4}}
Khái niệm dùng: fractional_exponents, power_rule, radicals

MAE · Applications of Derivatives · Logarithmic Differentiation
Đề: Find the first derivative of f(x)=(2x-e^{8x})^{\sin(2x)}.
LaTeX: f(x)=(2x-e^{8x})^{\sin(2x)}
Các bước giải: 
Đáp án: {'unit': None, 'value': "f'(x)=(2x-e^{8x})^{\\sin(2x)}\\left[2\\cos(2x)\\ln(2x-e^{8x})+\\sin(2x)\\frac{2-8e^{8x}}{2x-e^{8x}}\\right]", 'interpretation': 'The derivative is obtained using logarithmic differentiation.'}
